{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-markdown-remark-js","path":"/hitchhikers-guide/apps/docs/content/odh/superset/map_groups_to_roles.md","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"Operate First"}},"markdownRemark":{"id":"6b0e6bfd-e3ee-5783-894f-ca4fbd3381d7","html":"<h1 id=\"map-ocp-group-to-superset-role\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#map-ocp-group-to-superset-role\" aria-label=\"map ocp group to superset role permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Map OCP Group to Superset Role</h1>\n<p>To map a Superset role to an OCP group do the following:</p>\n<ol class=\"pf-c-list\">\n<li>Navigate to the Superset Config file <a href=\"https://github.com/operate-first/apps/blob/master/odh-manifests/smaug/superset/base/secret.yaml\">here</a></li>\n<li>Find <code class=\"language-text\">AUTH_ROLES_MAPPING</code> under <code class=\"language-text\">stringData.superset_config</code></li>\n<li>\n<p>Append this python dictionary with the OCP group and Superset Role using\nthe following format:</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"python\"><pre class=\"language-python\"><code class=\"language-python\">AUTH_ROLES_MAPPING <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"cluster-admins\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"Admin\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"operate-first\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"Admin\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"data-science\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"User\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"&lt;YOUR_OCP_GROUP_HERE>\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"&lt;SUPERSET_ROLES_HERE>\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Once done, submit a PR.</p>\n<p>Note that the ODH and Superset pod will need to be restarted after the PR is merged.</p>","fields":{"srcLink":"https://github.com/operate-first/apps/blob/master/docs/content/odh/superset/map_groups_to_roles.md"},"frontmatter":{"title":"","description":null,"extraClasses":null,"banner":null}}},"pageContext":{"id":"6b0e6bfd-e3ee-5783-894f-ca4fbd3381d7"}},"staticQueryHashes":["117426894","1764348645","3000541721","3606484676"]}